{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The girl forgets everything \u201cevery five minutes.\u201d</strong><br><strong>Only \u201cfive memories\u201d can be carried forward.</strong><br><strong>Choose wrong, and you'll never reach the truth!</strong><br><strong>Weave the fragments together, beyond the endless loop\u2014.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/b01097cb4c331aa7ffa40633e0653714.avif?t=1774652867\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/37294a13f1dc1cb257096b5ccf10eac1.avif?t=1774652867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras_big/37294a13f1dc1cb257096b5ccf10eac1.webp?t=1774652867 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhere am I? Who am I!?\u201d<br><br>Rim awoke in a stark, bare room.<br>She had no memory of who she was.<br><br>\u201cHey, Rim. What\u2019s with the blank stare?\u201d<br><br>Standing before her was a man claiming to be her brother, Shiba.<br>He said she was a maid nicknamed the \u201cIce Queen,\u201d but she still had no recollection.<br><br>Before she could process his words, a fierce dizziness overwhelmed her.<br><br>\u201cHuh? Where am I? Am I Rim?\u201d<br><br>Same room.<br>Same man.<br>Same conversation.<br><br>Something was clearly wrong.<br><br>Rim realized she was trapped in an inexplicable loop.<br>A strange loop where she could carry over only \u201cfive\u201d accumulated memories.<br><br>The closer she got to the truth, the more dangerous the situation became.<br>Could she escape this closed room?<br>What on earth is happening in the outside \u201cworld\u201d?<br><br>Sift through countless memories, overcome doubt and unease, and guide Rim to the \u201ctrue ending.\u201d<br>Beyond the struggle, a rewarding conclusion awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/89a14a063ba5bebe3fdd35dff09e37f8.avif?t=1774652867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras_big/89a14a063ba5bebe3fdd35dff09e37f8.webp?t=1774652867 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/e013c2f5fbc6bc574807730bc8a7aa09.avif?t=1774652867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras_big/e013c2f5fbc6bc574807730bc8a7aa09.webp?t=1774652867 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Progression\u3011<br>Memory Management Mystery Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deduction adventure game where you advance the story through short loops.<br><br>\u30fbUp to 5 memories can be carried over per loop<br>\u30fbGather memories by repeating conversations within each loop<br>\u30fbImmediately after a loop, the story changes based on which memories you set<br>\u30fbAcquire new memories through each conversation, then use them to further advance the story.<br>\u30fbRely on the \u201cinformation\u201d within memories and the \u201chint screen\u201d to find the correct combination.<br><br>When you select the correct memories, previously unseen inconsistencies and truths gradually come to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/ed07cb4a9bec80b4ef932f65bccff24a.avif?t=1774652867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras_big/ed07cb4a9bec80b4ef932f65bccff24a.webp?t=1774652867 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/422005ecbeb5e116c3f09df540baa29b.avif?t=1774652867\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Estimated Clear Time\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Playthrough: 2\u20134 hours<br>Ending: NORMAL and TRUE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*English and Simplified Chinese localization will be available at launch. We will continue optimizing based on user feedback.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053760?t=1774652867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/b11b75791c4bf31c14da449c0bea86d5864a14ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774652867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/13b6069c1cd714710b17b7aa7ad4865e99cccfe5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774652867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/13b6069c1cd714710b17b7aa7ad4865e99cccfe5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774652867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4185120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The girl forgets everything \u201cevery five minutes.\u201d</strong><br><strong>Only \u201cfive memories\u201d can be carried forward.</strong><br><strong>Choose wrong, and you'll never reach the truth!</strong><br><strong>Weave the fragments together, beyond the endless loop\u2014.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053760/extras/b01097cb4c331aa7ffa40633e0653714.avif?t=1774652867\" width=1560 height